WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.293
Explain ways to promote personal hygiene and safety.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:09.164
Personal hygiene helps us stay clean and comfortable. The curriculum lists soap,

00:00:09.164 --> 00:00:11.645
water, toothpaste, toothbrushes and nail cutters.

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:16.855
Wash hands with soap, brush teeth morning and night, bathe regularly, and keep

00:00:16.855 --> 00:00:21.261
clothing clean. Sharp tools are handled by an adult or under adult guidance.

00:00:22.117 --> 00:00:25.317
Demonstrate handwashing with an adult and write four steps.
